 degree of obstruction"]}]}, {"id": "Splash8:12b", "number": "12b", "name": "Simulate the Appearance and Treatment of a Conscious Adult or Child Victim with a Mild Obstructed Airway", "sourceLines": ["\u2022 Coughing encouraged", "\u2022 Reassurance for victim"], "subskills": [{"id": "Splash8:12b:1", "text": "Coughing encouraged", "group": []}, {"id": "Splash8:12b:2", "text": "Reassurance for victim", "group": []}]}, {"id": "Splash8:12c", "number": "12c", "name": "Simulate the Appearance and Treatment of a Conscious Adult or Child Victim with a Severe Obstructed Airway", "sourceLines": ["\u2022 Shout for help", "\u2022 Careful land marking", "\u2022 Repeated abdominal thrusts (chest thrusts for Pregnant or obese victim) until airway is clear", "\u2022 If successful, victim directed to see a physician to rule out complications from", "the obstruction or treatment"], "subskills": [{"id": "Splash8:12c:1", "text": "Shout for help", "group": []}, {"id": "Splash8:12c:2", "text": "Careful land marking", "group": []}, {"id": "Splash8:12c:3", "text": "Repeated abdominal thrusts (chest thrusts for Pregnant or obese victim) until airway is clear", "group": []}, {"id": "Splash8:12c:4", "text": "If successful, victim directed to see a physician to rule out complications from the obstruction or treatment", "group": []}]}, {"id": "Splash8:13a", "number": "13a", "name": "Demonstrate Ability to Simulate in the Water the Appearance of a Weak Swimmer, a Non-swimmer and an Unconscious Victim", "sourceLines": ["\u2022 Behaviour differentiating between the appearance of a weak swimmer an a non-swimmer;", "and the behaviour consistent with that of an unconscious victim"], "subskills": [{"id": "Splash8:13a:1", "text": "Behaviour differentiating between the appearance of a weak swimmer an a non-swimmer; and the behaviour consistent with that of an unconscious victim", "group": []}]}, {"id": "Splash8:13b", "number": "13b", "name": "Demonstrate the Ability to Recognize the Difference Between 